In the country of Estravia, freelancers pay income tax on their taxable income, which equals their gross fees (hourly rate × hours billed) minus their business expenses. Tax is charged in bands:
0% on the first $20,000 of taxable income;
20% on taxable income between $20,000 and $60,000;
35% on taxable income above $60,000.

The table shows five freelancers' figures for one year.

